OL,3,GNEWSASecurity operation continues for
OL,4,Aday-two of Donald Trump's visit to
OL,5,AIreland
OL,6,
OL,7,FA major security operation is
OL,8,Fcontinuing for US president Donald
OL,9,FTrump's visit to Ireland.
OL,11,FHe's on day two of the visit to the
OL,12,Fcountry, where he will spend the day at
OL,13,FTrump International Golf Links in
OL,14,FDoonbeg, County Clare for the Irish
OL,15,FOpen.
OL,17,FOn Saturday, he met Ireland's President
OL,18,FCatherine Connolly and the Taoiseach
OL,19,F(Irish PM) Micheal Martin.
